+// One number that sets how much money cities and developments earn relative to everything else (what things cost,
+// the Work button's minimum, Rank XP). Cities, developments, the daily bonus, offline earnings and events all scale
+// with it, and so does a Work click, which is worth a few seconds of passive income. Delay compensation and Progress
+// card cash prizes are multiplied by it too, so they stay as meaningful as they were.
+export const INCOME_SCALE = 20
